00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,150
Listen to a school radio announcement.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:13,110
Attention students, We apologize for the inconvenience caused by the recent changes to our work study program application process.

3
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:19,050
Unfortunately, due to system issues, some applications were not processed properly.

4
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:23,130
We are working to resolve this problem as quickly as possible.

5
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:26,949
Please resubmit your applications through the updated portal

6
00:00:26,949 --> 00:00:32,200
and phone the Career Center if you encounter any further issues.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:40,090
Additionally, we're pleased to announce several new part time work opportunities available on campus.

8
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:43,220
Feel free to stop by the Center to learn more.
